{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a peaceful park filled with mysteries, art and wild landscapes. Repair what has been broken, unlock the exit and learn the truth about what happened in The Valley.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living Art Park </strong><br>Wander through a world where wild landscapes blend with monumental art. Every corner invites you to discover something new.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Different Way to Play </strong><br>There are no quests, mini-maps, or combat. UI is minimal so you can explore at your own pace. All progress comes from your own curiosity and careful observation.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Yet Rewarding </strong><br>Enjoy a peaceful journey at your own pace. Most puzzles are gentle and encourage you to observe and think, but the park hides many deeper secrets for keen-eyed explorers seeking a thougher challenge.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Repair and Reveal </strong><br>Restore mechanisms to make your way forward. Each step brings you closer to unlocking the path out of the valley and learning the truth about your journey.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Mystery with Surprises </strong><br>The story ends with a twist that lets you see the park in a whole new light and discover the truth about its last inhabitants.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889780?t=1757692867","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889780?t=1757692867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/7e422c3e28a4385b50dce4ea7fda37ac25fda8b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757692867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/7e422c3e28a4385b50dce4ea7fda37ac25fda8b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757692867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a peaceful park filled with mysteries, art and wild landscapes. Repair what has been broken, unlock the exit and learn the truth about what happened in The Valley.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living Art Park </strong><br>Wander through a world where wild landscapes blend with monumental art. Every corner invites you to discover something new.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Different Way to Play </strong><br>There are no quests, mini-maps, or combat. UI is minimal so you can explore at your own pace. All progress comes from your own curiosity and careful observation.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Yet Rewarding </strong><br>Enjoy a peaceful journey at your own pace. Most puzzles are gentle and encourage you to observe and think, but the park hides many deeper secrets for keen-eyed explorers seeking a thougher challenge.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Repair and Reveal </strong><br>Restore mechanisms to make your way forward. Each step brings you closer to unlocking the path out of the valley and learning the truth about your journey.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Mystery with Surprises </strong><br>The story ends with a twist that lets you see the park in a whole new light and discover the truth about its last inhabitants.</h2>","developers":["Marmot Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/3e8aa37758a3239ddbb9d41c2de822dc92804e67/header.jpg?t=1757692867","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Yann Le Coroller <br />\r\nAll rights reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\