8.jpg?t=1757692867"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/8331421fefe19ce3b91c39fcd56f60aeb4079fc1/ss_8331421fefe19ce3b91c39fcd56f60aeb4079fc1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757692867","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/8331421fefe19ce3b91c39fcd56f60aeb4079fc1/ss_8331421fefe19ce3b91c39fcd56f60aeb4079fc1.600x338.jpg?t=1757692867"},{"id":14,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/6a3eddfb7682432e086214b5ab7588018b2f4311/ss_6a3eddfb7682432e086214b5ab7588018b2f4311.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757692867","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/6a3eddfb7682432e086214b5ab7588018b2f4311/ss_6a3eddfb7682432e086214b5ab7588018b2f4311.600x338.jpg?t=1757692867"}],"short_description":"Step into a fantastic landscape where art and nature hide many secrets. Solve puzzles and find hidden paths as you search for the truth and why the park can\u2019t let you leave. No enemies, no waypoints, no hand-holding: curiosity is your only fuel for piecing the park many mysteries.","steam_appid":3889780,"support_info":{"email":"marmotlabmail@gmail.com","url":"https://sites.google.com/view/explorebeyondthevalley/home"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://sites.google.com/view/explorebeyondthevalley/home"}